    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d608-a9">

                <pb facs="1072" n="978" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg978"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inelosure 6 to inclosure in No.
                    141.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Moffer to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 3,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have visited this city to do some work at
                    the oil refinery without a passport, and find that it is required before I can
                    procure a ticket to return to New York.</p>
                <p>I arrived here on the steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Niagara</hi> on the 28th
                    ultimo, and wish to return by the same steamer on the 4th instant.</p>
                <p>Please inform me what I shall do to procure the necessary passport.</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#italic">P. M. Moffer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
